@startuml uc_admin_dashboard
left to right direction
title SIGAP - Use Case: Administrasi Konten & Sistem (Tahap 2)

actor "Admin" as Admin
actor "Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Sistem SIGAP" {
  usecase "Login" as UC0
  usecase "Kelola Kontak Darurat" as UC6
  usecase "Kelola Titik & Jalur Evakuasi" as UC7
  usecase "Kelola Panduan Kesiapsiagaan" as UC7b
  usecase "Klasifikasi Alert" as UC8b
  usecase "Manajemen Perangkat IoT" as UC12
  usecase "Lihat Riwayat Status Device" as UC13
  usecase "Lihat Riwayat Aktivasi Sirine" as UC14
  usecase "Manajemen Akun & Role" as UC15
  usecase "Lihat Dashboard Admin" as UC16
}

Admin --> UC0
Operator --> UC0

Admin --> UC6
Operator --> UC6
Admin --> UC7
Operator --> UC7
Admin --> UC7b
Operator --> UC7b
Admin --> UC8b
Operator --> UC8b
Admin --> UC12
Operator --> UC12
Admin --> UC13
Operator --> UC13
Admin --> UC14
Operator --> UC14
Admin --> UC16
Operator --> UC16

Admin --> UC15
note right of UC15
  Khusus role Admin - satu-satunya
  pembeda fungsional antara Admin
  dan Operator di seluruh sistem
  (FS-10). Operator TIDAK punya
  akses ke use case ini.
end note

UC6 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC7 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC7b .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC8b .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC12 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC13 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC14 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC15 .> UC0 : <<include>>
UC16 .> UC0 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC0
  RBAC sudah final & di-seed
  (admin: content.manage,
  alert.validate, device.view,
  device.manage, siren.view,
  user.manage; operator: sama
  minus user.manage). Enforcement
  middleware belum diimplementasikan
  di kode (Story SEC-1).
end note

note "Kelola Pengumuman DIHAPUS dari\ncakupan diagram ini - sumber data\npindah jadi proxy read-only dari SID\n(Roadmap Tahap 2)." as N1

@enduml